/E (   When I got back to Storybend, the first thing I did was walk to the beach, and Killian was there, where I knew he would be. He walked over to me, and hugged me, lifting all 180 pounds of me into his arms and spinning me around as though I weighed nothing. Days later, we began scheduling our wedding plans, though we were going to be getting married in secret. That had to be postponed, sadly. )
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
630 0 obj
<<
