/P 286 0 R
/E (    As all hybrids do, I had to travel dimensions to regain my strength. As I went back to Acirema, I spent some time with my granddaughter, Rose, and her wife, Sophie. They lived a happy life together, and for the first time I could truthfully say that I was proud of how badly things turned out, because in the end everything was okay.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [1]
>>
