/E (     But Ryan-Lucas is the one man who I would never in a million years, and a thousand more lifetimes, allow to get me pregnant. His darkness was still there. When I would rest my head on his chest, smelling her nasty Beach Breeze perfume on his clothes, I could hear the whispers of the shadows in his sould, and I knew. )
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [3]
>>
